Z||000000||dennis_6||09-24-2001||11:40 PM||||I have missed out on alot of good deals becasue I don't have a truck to go pick up stuff. Trucks are so expensive now because everyone and his brother wants one. I found out a chevy astro can tow 5000 pounds or haul 1500 pounds.  You can even put a V8 in the van without much more diffculty than replacing the stock 4.3 v6.  I am going to find me a cheap one sooner or later so I can haul parts cars.  Hope this helps some one.||||reg||7
